{"title":"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first 14 integers are written in order around a circle.\n</p><p>Starting with 1, every fifth integer is underlined. (That is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/a/b7a354eb67af2769a901159cbc71a2253e7ffced.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,6,11,2,7,\\ldots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"114\" height=\"16\" />).\nWhat is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/0/400101c6d0547c9231a429d48cc80ed73aae8c1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006^{th}$\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" /> number underlined?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/3/953b3ed19882010780e63c1f5a6644729f8a74d3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw(unitcircle,black); pair A; for(int j=1;j&lt;15;++j){ A=dir(90-(j-1)*(360/14)); MP(string(j),A,A); } [/asy]\" width=\"248\" height=\"252\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The way the numbers cycle are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/2/bc200abd6919345d62f2489208f2a5feed875bf1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 6, 11, 2, 7, 12, 3, 8, 13, 4, 9, 14, 5, 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"277\" height=\"16\" /> for a total of 14 numbers. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/6/34682e2ea8797bb611eb8f374afb2b5d55656fa6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006\\div14=143R4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"151\" height=\"13\" />, with a remainder of 4. The fourth number in the cycle is 2, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/1/d913c406f23f63b9dbac708ee7cab5f0709b6ea4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II\">2006 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style